[46.457913, "o", "y.whl` from Python's bundled `ensurepip` cache directly into site-packages, restoring the `pip` module. Both `pip3 --version` and `python3 -m pip --version` now work, and package installation is functional.\r\n\r\n[refusal] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=22 surface=48cd0ade3676\r\n"]
